{"id":"wb-7-949","name":"思本桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"思本桥","text":"思本桥又名思汾桥，位于中国江苏省苏州市吴江区江陵街道联兴村（原同里镇辽浜村），建于南宋。\n\n2013年3月5日，思本桥公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，编号7-0949-3-247。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%80%9D%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":91849138,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91849138","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null,"textScope":"body-excerpt"}